WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
We're not that bad looking, so it's okay to find other men for some food.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,320
Now everyone regards supplies as their name, no matter how cold the weather is

3
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:12,820
Even if we took the initiative to post it, they would not care about anything else.

4
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,320
Did you forget that there is Zhang Yi?

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:18,320
She had stocked up on a lot of supplies. She must have more food than ordinary households.

6
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:21,820
If you are a little softer, she will definitely bring you food.

7
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:25,320
But when I went to see her before, her attitude was very cold.

8
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:28,820
She just has low self-esteem and feels she's not good enough for you, so she deliberately alienates you.

9
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:32,850
She brought it all on herself!

10
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:36,850
An ordinary middle-class person puts on airs and wastes my time.

11
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:39,850
After all, it is a high-quality spare tire. Spare tires are meant for emergencies.

12
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:43,350
If you show some good looks, she will immediately send all the supplies willingly.

13
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:48,700
A few days ago, I was accompanied by a thin-skinned man, which hurts me.
